{"seconds": 137.9, "exit": 0, "final": "**Best move:** Rh5+\n\n**Main line:** Rh5+ Kg4 Rxh4+ Kg5 (and White has won Black's rook)\n\n**Motif:** fork, attraction\n\n**Coaching note:**\nLook for forcing moves that attack multiple pieces at once. Rh5+ is a royal fork\u2014it checks the king and attacks the undefended rook simultaneously. After the king moves (e.g., Kg4), you capture the rook with check (Rxh4+), winning material decisively. Black's best try is to trade rooks immediately, but you still get a better position. Always scan for moves that force your opponent into a losing choice.\n\n(58 words)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"move\": \"Rh5+\",\n  \"line\": [\"Rh5+\", \"Kg4\", \"Rxh4+\", \"Kg5\"],\n  \"motifs\": [\"fork\", \"attraction\"]\n}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "7R/ppp2r2/5p2/6k1/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 w - - 2 32"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "7R/ppp2r2/5p2/6k1/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 w - - 2 32"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "7R/ppp2r2/5p2/6k1/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 w - - 2 32"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "7R/ppp2r2/5p2/6k1/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 w - - 2 32", "move": "Rh5+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "8/ppp2r2/5p2/6kR/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 b - - 3 32", "square": "h5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/ppp2r2/5p2/6kR/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 b - - 3 32", "move": "Rxh5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/ppp2r2/5p2/6kR/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 b - - 3 32", "move": "Kxh5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "7R/ppp2r2/5p2/6k1/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 w - - 2 32", "move": "Rg8+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "6R1/ppp2r2/5p2/6k1/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 b - - 3 32", "move": "Rg7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "7R/ppp2r2/5p2/6k1/7r/P7/1P6/1K1R4 w - - 2 32", "move": "Rd5+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "7R/ppp2r2/5p